---
description: Never add Cursor or any AI as a git Co-authored-by
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git attribution

- Commits are authored only by the human Git identity.
- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any Cursor/agent trailer.
- Do not change git config.
- If a UI or hook injects a Cursor co-author line, strip it before the commit is created.
